/wiki/%E6%A7%B2%E5%AF%84%E7%94%9F\" title=\"槲寄生\"><img alt=\"槲寄生\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-300301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c7/HeadIconSmall-300301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A7%B2%E5%AF%84%E7%94%9F\" title=\"槲寄生\">槲寄生</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>21又1</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：300306</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3003/300306/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\"><i>“您是死亡的先兆、动乱的母亲、乌鸦的主人。”</i><br />他们在石头与树皮上刻下文字，一行蚂蚁在文字上徘徊过数个来回，它们用啮齿蚕食着祭坛上带血的活肉。<br />“您带来灾难，带来战争，带来哭泣与无尽的苦风。”<br />祭师称颂着晦涩的名字，他们的身体战栗着，为未曾到来的启示。绵延的风声拉长了这未言明的恐惧，所有人的目光都紧紧地盯着祭坛，如同渴水者正凝视绿洲。<br />“茉莉安，茉莉安……”<br />终于有人念出了这个名字，随后声如洪浪，不可阻挡，其中夹杂着细微的抽泣与哭号。<br />干枯的树顶微微颤动，一片荒芜之中，唯有槲寄生仍然常青。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"300306\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300308.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/43/Belonging-300308.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">渡鸦羽冠<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Raven Wing Crown</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />30<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由羽毛、荆棘与锻铁制成的头冠，整体呈翼式结构，顶部装饰有排列整齐的渡鸦羽毛，整体呈现深邃的蓝紫色光泽。它与她钟爱的术杖一道，将见证丰饶再度降临这片林地。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300309.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/ca/Belonging-300309.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">荆棘螺旋术杖<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Spiral Thorn Wand</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一根黑木雕刻成的术杖，表面被山楂茎刺缠绕，呈螺旋状向上延伸。<br />相传，这些荆棘是为古老的满月仪式而准备的，只要献上虔诚，便可换取自然的庇佑。当然，没人能确认这是否属实，除了受访者。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-300310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/98/Belonging-300310.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“洞见与启示”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Insight and Revelation\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>乌鸦停在荆棘枝头，不来也不去。<br />“从它们口中吐露出的嘶哑声音，到底预示着什么？”<br />听闻此言，受访者仅作微笑，不置可否。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%841.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 荆棘环绕处1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%841.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%841.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%841.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%841.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%841.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%841.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%842.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 荆棘环绕处2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%842.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%842.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%842.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%842.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%842.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%8D%86%E6%A3%98%E7%8E%AF%E7%BB%95%E5%A4%842.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">荆棘环绕处 <small style=\"color: grey\">Shrouded in Thorns</small></span></span>"}}